@prefix ag: <http://example.org/agora#> .

#  Succulent's agent's PRIVATE beliefs. Note how far these diverge from fern's: it wants a
#  fifth of the moisture, shrugs at readings that would have fern bidding hard, and is
#  content to look rarely and to trust older data. Same world, same ontology, different mind.

##  ag:Subscribing
ag:succulent_agent
    ag:fastSleepS 60 ;
    ag:slowSleepS 900 ;
    ag:readingGraceS 45 .

##  ag:Bidding
ag:succulent_agent
    ag:hasEndowment 100.0 ;
    ag:hasTarget 0.22 ;
    ag:bandLow 0.12 ;
    ag:bandHigh 0.30 ;
    ag:litresPerFraction 2.0 ;
    ag:maxValuePerL 0.80 .

##  How often it says how it is — belief base size, reading freshness, silent write failures.
#   Omit this line and the agent reports nothing; see agora/metrics.py.
ag:succulent_agent ag:metricsIntervalS 60 .

##  Self-review — how often at the very least, and how much room it gives itself.
#   Omit ag:reviewIntervalS and it never revises anything: its beliefs stay exactly what
#   genesis wrote. The commitment is the SELF constraint — narrower than the constitution's
#   10..900 — so the figure above is a first pick rather than a floor, and this says how far
#   the agent will let itself wander from it. See decisions/a-belief-is-a-pick-within-a-range.
ag:succulent_agent ag:reviewIntervalS 300 .
ag:succulent_agent ag:commits [ ag:onTerm ag:slowSleepS ; ag:notBelow 900 ; ag:notAbove 900 ] .
